---
 Mire review | unified | focus: review
 Files                 Navigation and layout
> file.txt             q / Esc      quit
  image.bin            ?            toggle help
                       Tab          switch sidebar/review focus
                       j / Down     scroll or select next file
                       k / Up       scroll or select previous file
                       PgDn         page down
                       PgUp         page up
                       g / Home     first row
                       G / End      last row
                       ]            next file
                       [            previous file
                       n            next hunk
                       N            previous hunk
                       1            unified layout
                       2            split layout
                       3            automatic layout
                       wheel        scroll review or sidebar
                       left click   select a sidebar or review file



 Tab: focus | j/k: move | [ ]: files | n/N: hunks | 1/2/3: layout | ?: help | q: quit
